{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"id":"ZhipuAI.ZCode","latestVersion":"3.17.2","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"author":"Beijing Zhipu Huazhang Technology Co., Ltd.","copyright":"© 2026 Z Code. All rights reserved.","description":"Z Code combines the best AI agents with your existing tools so you can plan, code, review, and deploy without friction.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Document","DocumentUrl":"https://zhipu-ai.feishu.cn/wiki/VpgrwtBcyiU59zk9fMEcm2sFnee"}],"license":"Proprietary","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"author":"Beijing Zhipu Huazhang Technology Co., Ltd.","copyright":"© 2026 Z Code. All rights reserved.","description":"Z Code combines the best AI agents with your existing tools so you can plan, code, review, and deploy without friction.","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"Document","DocumentUrl":"https://zhipu-ai.feishu.cn/wiki/VpgrwtBcyiU59zk9fMEcm2sFnee"}],"license":"Proprietary","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Z Code is a lightweight AI code editor designed to address the high operational barrier of command-line AI programming tools (such as Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, etc.). By providing a unified and user-friendly visual desktop interface, it seamlessly integrates the capabilities of these Agents, allowing smooth switching and experience across multiple Agent programming tools with just one API key. Additionally, it offers a series of features including secure file version management, efficient code review, task agents, MCP protocol management, and more, delivering you an all-in-one AI-assisted development experience.","name":"Z Code","packageUrl":"https://zcode-ai.com/","publisher":"Z.AI","publisherUrl":"https://z.ai/","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","claude-code","code","codex","coding","gemini-cli","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"author":"北京智谱华章科技有限公司","description":"Z Code 将最佳的 AI 代理与您现有的工具相结合，让您能够顺畅地进行规划、编码、审查和部署。","documentations":[{"DocumentLabel":"文档","DocumentUrl":"https://zhipu-ai.feishu.cn/wiki/VpgrwtBcyiU59zk9fMEcm2sFnee"}],"license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Z Code 是一款轻量级的 AI 代码编辑器，旨在解决命令行 AI 编程工具（如 Claude Code、Codex、Gemini 等）操作门槛高的问题。它通过提供一个统一、友好的可视化桌面，将这些 Agent 的能力无缝集成，仅使用一个 api key 就能丝滑切换体验多个 Agent 编程工具。此外，还提供安全的文件版本管理、高效代码审查、任务 Agent、MCP 协议管理等一系列特性，为你打造一站式的 AI 辅助开发体验。","releaseNotes":"新功能\n- 新增 ZCode Sites 官方插件，支持一键部署网站\n- 插件管理支持一键全部更新\n- 新增 Kimi K3.1 Pro、MiniMax M3.1 Flash 等模型配置项\n- 文档查看器按会话隔离，多个文档插件共用进程降低占用\n- 图片预览支持标注编辑并作为附件发送\n- 新增未读任务筛选\n- 设置页可批量管理项目，删除时可同时清理数据\n- 设置页统一远程数据同步功能\n- 远程设备改为紧凑的可搜索列表\n- 远程设备菜单支持停止、重启远端服务\n- 工作流因配额暂停后，配额重置时自动继续运行\n- Computer Use 新增多会话光标\n- 未安装 Node 的电脑上 MCP 服务器也能正常启动\n- 预览卡片整卡点击即可直接打开\n- 新增 MCP 配置界面（草稿版）\n- 文件卡片、正文链接和打开菜单支持「在 Finder/资源管理器中打开」并定位到文件\n问题修复\n- 配置文件损坏时不再被覆盖，避免数据丢失\n- 未打开项目时也能完成用户级数据迁移\n- 父子技能现在会一起同步，不再遗漏\n- 长对话的流式回复卡顿明显减少\n- 修复部分远程兼容性问题\n- 回复被安全策略拦截时快速报错，不再反复重试\n- 模型内置工具的调用过程和结果可完整显示\n- 无进展的重复执行会自动结束并提示\n- 错峰套餐到期后不再自动续费\n- Windows 窗口被其他程序遮挡后恢复正常显示\n- 删除项目后可正常新建任务\n- 修复 macOS 安装包丢失中英文语言资源的问题\n- 安装包体积明显减小\n- 浏览器附件链接不再被反复下载\n- 微信自动化任务的结果推送恢复正常\n- 修复会话切换与恢复时的归属问题，避免串到其他会话\n- 修复 Windows 64 位安装包可能混入不兼容组件的问题\n- 托盘图标不再显示未读红点，未读状态仍可在任务栏查看\n- 修复计划模式下可能放行高风险操作的问题\n- 子任务权限与主会话保持一致，计划模式下同样受限\n- 限制本地网页预览可访问的范围，提升安全性\n- MCP 启动失败时显示更具体的原因和解决办法\n- 收紧 MCP 设置检测权限，仅限已注册的工作区\n- 自定义命令中的脚本改为经权限确认后执行\n- 修复 Windows 上插件命令路径导致脚本出错的问题\n- 修复 Windows 上部分文件无法用默认应用打开的问题\n- 修复 macOS 上部分应用图标显示空白的问题\n- 修复产物卡片偶尔不刷新的问题","tags":["claude-code","codex","gemini-cli","人工智能","代码","大语言模型","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"longDescription":"Z Code is a lightweight AI code editor designed to address the high operational barrier of command-line AI programming tools (such as Claude Code, Codex, Gemini, etc.). By providing a unified and user-friendly visual desktop interface, it seamlessly integrates the capabilities of these Agents, allowing smooth switching and experience across multiple Agent programming tools with just one API key. Additionally, it offers a series of features including secure file version management, efficient code review, task agents, MCP protocol management, and more, delivering you an all-in-one AI-assisted development experience.","name":"Z Code","packageUrl":"https://zcode-ai.com/","publisher":"Z.AI","publisherUrl":"https://z.ai/","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","claude-code","code","codex","coding","gemini-cli","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.17.2/app.json","detailSha256":"7442a64aa52b516f81963fa675b3f3b21926e903e281dd519919eae99d194104","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"3.17.2"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.16.3/app.json","detailSha256":"8492f679ac37efb559d83449584b9c6ad0ebdaa5f1eb34bfb2efe14b64020fb9","releaseDate":"2026-10-23","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.16.3"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.16.2/app.json","detailSha256":"d74931d24bbb3f256309b65c42a22ea1f95589396f4b385019b14026d04e14e5","releaseDate":"2026-10-20","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.16.2"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.15.3/app.json","detailSha256":"dc234b4b2b12bed2b22cfcddaedf4d361e981dcf0e402055427f1c961fdde4f6","releaseDate":"2026-10-13","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.15.3"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.14.5/app.json","detailSha256":"f68408878f2b44c1d7e0854448fe7c4dd04e2b964423e56fc366ecb9e8ead882","releaseDate":"2026-10-09","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"3.14.5"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.14.3/app.json","detailSha256":"ace2de9d3b1cb4260332278f650d58d7f9a1279fe4d3f16c7558c82826bdc308","releaseDate":"2026-11-09","releaseDateSource":"commit","version":"3.14.3"},{"architectures":["arm64","x64"],"detailPath":"versions/3.14.1/app.json","detailSha256":"87cd6e2e035fe8963597f84ae7807dae706288c658a21d3493b5c9df8bd09838","releaseDat